---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Single-person studio · {{ site.location }}</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Privacy-focussed apps, built faster with AI. <em>Your team can work the same way.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-lead">We make apps that keep your data on your device. We build them with AI coding agents every day, and we write up how, costs and mistakes included. Then we help other teams work the same way.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="#apps">See the apps</a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/consulting/">AI consulting</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section products" id="apps" aria-labelledby="apps-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 id="apps-title">Apps and tools</h2>
      <p>Made with care in Sydney. No ads, no tracking, and nothing more than they need.</p>
    </header>
    <ul class="product-grid">
      {#- asyncEach, not for: the card uses the async image shortcode -#}
      {%- asyncEach app in apps | sortProducts %}
      {% include "partials/product-card.njk" %}
      {%- endeach %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section consulting" id="consulting" aria-labelledby="consulting-title">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Consulting</p>
      <h2 id="consulting-title">AI coding agents, set up properly.</h2>
      <p>We help development teams put Claude Code, Codex, Copilot and Gemini to work, set up the way we use them on our own apps. We start with how your team really works, and finish with a documented setup they know how to use.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/how-we-set-up-our-ai-agents/">Read how we set up our own <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/consulting/">Explore consulting</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="{{ site.calendlyUrl }}">Book a free 15-minute call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>Analysis of your team’s real workflow</li>
      <li>Agent setup to current best practice</li>
      <li>Training, materials and documentation</li>
      <li>On-site in Sydney, remote anywhere</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{%- set latestPosts = (collections.posts or []) | reverse %}
{%- if latestPosts.length %}
<section class="section blog" id="blog" aria-labelledby="blog-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 id="blog-title">From the blog</h2>
    </header>
    {%- set post = latestPosts[0] %}
    {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
    <p class="section-more"><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">All posts <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
